[{"data":1,"prerenderedAt":327},["ShallowReactive",2],{"gql:data:8j4T2DZhD6BtaLYXXMjsTHcZ8v4FEP-ZhWCXSLcQk6s":3},{"teamMember":4},{"abbreviatedTitle":5,"bio":6,"image":7,"highlightStatement":9,"companies":18,"derivedSeoDescription":10,"derivedSeoTitle":115,"derivedSocialMediaDescription":10,"derivedSocialMediaImage":10,"derivedSocialMediaTitle":115,"emailAddress":116,"firstName":117,"focusAreas":118,"fullName":119,"fullTitle":5,"introduction":120,"lastName":121,"linkedinProfileUrl":122,"substackProfileUrl":123,"slug":124,"teamHighlights":125,"testimonials":138,"contentPosts":139,"twitterProfielUrl":9},"Venture Partner","I am currently Chief Product and AI Officer at Atlassian. Over the past few months, I’ve met with incredible founders and executives, gaining an up-close view of how AI is transforming every industry and reshaping the way we work. It has become clear that every product we use today must be reimagined for this new era—and that is something I’m deeply motivated to help drive.\r\n\r\nPreviously, I was at Glean, where we built an AI-powered work assistant. Before that, I had the privilege of working at exceptional companies during their growth phases, including Amazon, Google, and Slack. Having been in the trenches—building products people love and scaling organizations to meet extraordinary demand—I learned enduring lessons about product leadership, execution, and scale.\r\n\r\nAt IVP, I share these learnings with entrepreneurs building the next generation of companies that will meaningfully improve people’s daily lives. I focus on supporting each company wherever I can, always acting with empathy for the incredibly difficult work founders do. As new technologies continue to emerge, the opportunity for startups has never been greater, and I’m excited to partner with entrepreneurs as they turn ambitious visions into reality.",{"id":8,"alt":9,"caption":10,"assetUrl":11,"assetUrlXs":12,"assetUrlSm":13,"assetUrlMd":14,"assetUrlLg":15,"assetUrlXl":16,"assetU